'''''Seabiscuit''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[In Our Time]].

==Steps==
# Learn about the challenge from the guide
# Pass the first "School of Acting" test
# Pass the second "School of Acting" test
# Pass the third "School of Acting" test
# Use Clockwork on the strict judge
# Go to the second stage entrance
# Select the stage you wish to challenge
# Learn about the challenge from the guide
# Pass the first "School of Action" test
# Pass the second "School of Action" test
# Pass the third "School of Action" test
# Go to the second stage entrance
# Select the stage you wish to challenge
# Learn about the challenge from the guide

