===Pass the first "School of Acting" test{{subst:void|<!--103270202-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Dialogue Judge)
:'''Dialogue Judge:''' Oof, just take a look at this pair. Such star quality! Since you've come as a pair, I'll prep a two-person scene for you!
:'''Dialogue Judge:''' You two, are you ready?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Ready.
:'''Dialogue Judge:''' Envision that you both, driven by the spirit of exploration, are arriving at the land of dreams that is Penacony for the first time. But! Instead of lush lands, you find yourselves amidst swirling sands and desolation, far from the paradise the Watchmaker described.
:{{tx}}
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Great! I love living on the wild side!
::'''Firefly:''' No... that's not right... You're trying to express disappointment. Why do you sound so chipper?
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} A brutish creature! Quick! Let's run it over!
::'''Firefly:''' Uh... Do you usually express disappointment this way...?
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
