::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} O, Penacony, my Penacony! You truly abound with opportunities!
:::'''Dialogue Judge:''' But at this moment, your partner yet gazes into the sky, both her eyes closed. The rain drops fall, blurring her vision, and she tragically says...
:::{{tx}}
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Just let me die of thirst instead!
:::'''Firefly:''' That's not right... That line doesn't sound very "surprised".
:::{{tx}}
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Perhaps we were never meant to succeed.
:::'''Firefly:''' We're already at the next scene! You need to convey surprise now, not disappointment...
:::{{tx}}
